          "block_content": " $$ \\sum_{m\\geq2n+1}x^{m}y^{n}=\\sum_{n}y^{n}\\frac{x^{2n+1}}{1-x}=\\frac{x^{3}y}{(1-x)(1-x^{2}y)} $$ ",
